  "messages": [
    {
      "from": "p_teo",
      "minute": 0,
      "text": "morning all. Kai, quick one before work: can you remind us the bin rota for this week?"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 1,
      "text": "Morning! This week Bram is on bins, Mila has the recycling, and Teodora is on the kitchen deep-clean."
    },
    {
      "from": "p_bram",
      "minute": 2,
      "text": "ugh fine. also heads up, my sister Mila is visiting from Ghent next weekend, she'll crash on the sofa"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_mila",
      "minute": 3,
      "text": "the other Mila 😄 cool with me"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_teo",
      "minute": 4,
      "text": "sure. Bram is she the one who's a vet?"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_bram",
      "minute": 5,
      "text": "yep, she's a large-animal vet, mostly horses"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_teo",
      "minute": 7,
      "text": "nice. ok big news from me actually: I left Larkspur, started at Quillmoor Labs on Monday"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 8,
      "text": "Congratulations, Teodora! What's the new role at Quillmoor Labs?"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_teo",
      "minute": 9,
      "text": "supply chain analyst. fully remote on fridays which is the dream"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_mila",
      "minute": 10,
      "text": "finally!! drinks on thursday then"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_bram",
      "minute": 12,
      "text": "did anyone watch the derby last night? what a mess of a second half"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_mila",
      "minute": 13,
      "text": "don't. I'm still annoyed about the penalty"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_bram",
      "minute": 14,
      "text": "ref needs glasses honestly"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 15,
      "text": "Rough match. Want me to put Thursday drinks for Teodora's new job in the house calendar?"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_teo",
      "minute": 16,
      "text": "yes please, 7pm at the Anchor"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 17,
      "text": "Done: Thursday 7pm at the Anchor is in the house calendar."
    },
    {
      "from": "p_mila",
      "minute": 60,
      "text": "random q for the flat: I'm going vegetarian from this month, so maybe no more shared mince in the freezer?"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_bram",
      "minute": 61,
      "text": "fair, I'll label my stuff"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_teo",
      "minute": 62,
      "text": "Mila are you doing it for health or climate?"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_mila",
      "minute": 63,
      "text": "climate mostly. and I'm allergic to shellfish anyway so seafood was already out"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 64,
      "text": "Noted. I can keep a vegetarian-friendly list for the shared shopping."
    },
    {
      "from": "p_bram",
      "minute": 66,
      "text": "while we're at it, the boiler guy comes wednesday between 8 and 12"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_teo",
      "minute": 67,
      "text": "I'm out wednesday, can someone be home?"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_mila",
      "minute": 68,
      "text": "I work from home wednesdays, I'll let him in"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_bram",
      "minute": 120,
      "text": "update on my sister: she's not coming next weekend after all, moved to the 21st"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_teo",
      "minute": 121,
      "text": "ok sofa free then"
    },
    {
      "from": "assistant",
      "minute": 122,
      "text": "Got it, Bram's sister Mila now visits around the 21st."
    },
    {
      "from": "p_bram",
      "minute": 123,
      "text": "also correction from earlier, she's not mostly horses anymore, she switched to a small-animal clinic in Ghent in the spring"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_mila",
      "minute": 124,
      "text": "wait so she does cats and dogs now?"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_bram",
      "minute": 125,
      "text": "yeah, cats, dogs and the occasional ferret"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_teo",
      "minute": 126,
      "text": "lol. ok I'm off, have a good one"
    },
    {
      "from": "p_mila",
      "minute": 127,
      "text": "bye!"
    }
  ],
